## Changes Executed

- Created private schema `app_private`.
- Created canonical helpers:
  `app_private.current_user_company_id()`
  `app_private.current_user_has_permission(text)`
- Helpers use `auth.uid()` + `public.users.auth_id`, not JWT user_metadata.
- Helpers use `SET search_path=''` and are not exposed from `public`.
- Replaced broad/user_metadata RLS policies with company/permission scoped policies.
- Hardened identified function search_path values to `public, pg_temp`.
- Revoked API-role EXECUTE from exposed SECURITY DEFINER RPCs; retained service_role execution.

